\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Geometry of an elliptical prismatic $a$-loop. The perspective drawing is schematic rather than metrically crystallographic. The loop plane contains $[0001]$ and one basal $a$ direction. The major axis is close to $[0001]$ and the minor axis lies in the basal plane. The Burgers vector is basal, while the measured habit-plane normal need not be exactly parallel to it.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
